uiry."}],"policyAssessment":{"status":"undetermined","explanation":"No normative policy was supplied; this is a behavior investigation. The implementation behavior is only conditionally determined because the authorization, version-resolution, and file-serving helper bodies are not shown."}}],"observations":[],"scope":"Only the source-visible download action, its shown file_response logic, the shown document-view routing evidence, and identified helper dependencies in paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx@126ec414a8b65158368653a2604ae58415e43103 were investigated. This is not a claim of all-repository coverage."}}
